      "caption": "",
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Option A: Participate live during each live Zoom lecture. Join a live Zoom lecture. Use Poll Everywhere during the lecture to complete the participation assignment Note: You can get credit for participation once for each assignment. If you do the assignment in Learning Catalytics, you do not need to do the asynchronous assignment. A zero will appear in the Canvas grade book if you do not complete the Learning Catalytics assignment. It will be deleted when your asynchronous assignment is graded. Option B: Participate asynchronously by watching the recorded Lecture Videos (posted at the bottom of the Learning Materials page for the module). After a video is posted, you can access the corresponding asynchronous participation assignment here: M2-1asy M2-2asy M2-3asy M2-4asy M2-5asy M2-6asy M2-7asy Feel free to switch back and forth between live participation and asynchronous participation as your schedule allows."
    },
    {
      "caption": "",
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Option 1: Take the quiz asynchronously. Quiz 2A_asy (Remotely Proctored) Quiz 2A_asy_work Quiz 2B_asy (Remotely Proctored) Quiz 2B_asy_work Option 2: Join a live Zoom session and take the quiz then. Quiz 2A Quiz 2A_6pm Quiz 2B Quiz 2B_6pm"
